[UPDATED] &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Personal settings&lt;/strong&gt; experience in model-driven apps has been modernized with clearer organization, updated navigation, and a more consistent design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Users can select a button to return to the classic &lt;strong&gt;Personal settings&lt;/strong&gt; experience if needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Availa (GA: December CY2026) — Power Apps

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;The new Code node lets makers run Python as a step in a workflow for logic that expressions and connectors can't handle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data transforms, calculations, regex, and advanced parsing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;File conversion and parsing (for example PDF → text, CSV, XML).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate the code fro (GA: November CY2026) — Microsoft Copilot Studio

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;The Agent node can now return files that the agent generates, such as PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, and CSV, as workflow outputs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with both inline agents and existing (published) agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generated files appear as an ordered files output (name, content type, content) th (GA: November CY2026) — Microsoft Copilot Studio

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Makers can share a workflow with other users as co-owners so they can view, edit, and manage it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share from the workflows page or the designer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review the connections the workflow uses and their permissions before sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See who the workflow is shared with when re (GA: December CY2026) — Microsoft Copilot Studio

&lt;p&gt;Real-time streaming analytics is built into the new supervisor application. An advanced streaming engine keeps metrics up to date with near-instant updates, allowing supervisors to view the latest data without refreshing the dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key capabilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
